      "name": "MiniStore",
      "developerName": "The-Big-Mini",
      "subtitle": "SideStore with UI upgrades and preloaded sources",
      "localizedDescription": "MiniStore is SideStore with the interface sanded down.\n\nEverything SideStore does, MiniStore does — it sideloads apps onto your device with just an Apple ID, resigns them with your personal development certificate, and refreshes them in the background so the 7-day development period never expires.\n\nWhat it adds:\n\n• OLED dark mode — true black throughout, applied live without a relaunch.\n• Accent colour theming — presets or a custom colour, across every tab and the home screen widget.\n• Reorganised settings — a list of categories instead of one long scroll.\n• Tab customization — hide the tabs you don't use and choose which one opens on launch.\n• What's New — release notes read straight from GitHub.\n• A preloaded catalogue so there is something to browse immediately.\n\nMiniStore is a thin layer on top of SideStore, kept deliberately small so upstream releases can be merged in as they land.",
